    "title": "League of Women Voters Holding Candidates Forum For San Miguel CSD 09.25.2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The League of Women Voters San Luis Obispo county will be holding a forum for candidates of the San Miguel Community Services District board of directors. The forum will be held Thursday, October 1st from 6 to 7:30 pm at the San Miguel senior center, 601 12th st. There are five full term candidates: John M. Butler II, Owen Davis, Andrew H. Harvard, John R McClure, and Rod Smiley. And two partial term candidates: Berkeley J. Baker, and Raynette Martines. Read full article",
